  "limitations": [
    "The BtbN recipe archives are a partial set and may include stages that do not contribute code to the shipped binaries. Nested inputs and notices still need review. AMF, mingw-w64, opencore-amr and soxr archives are missing.",
    "TagLibSharp archive is the upstream release source; NuGet does not record a source commit, so binary reproducibility is not established.",
    "The Mac recipe candidate matches the version report where pinned, but the build commit is unconfirmed and x264 was fetched from a moving branch. The corresponding dependency sources and notices remain incomplete."
